ew VTuber.\nI would like to request an illustration from you if possible.\n\n[Character]\n∙ A goblin boy who lives in a cave.\nI love to read (BL) fanfiction and 2000's nostalgia.\nHe is caring and dependable.\nHis pet mascot is a cedar pollen monster.\n\nCharacter reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PHkMoOBeKwQlUifMTpj2BKctCe0dXtCi?usp=sharing\n\nI would be happy to draw him however you like. He will look very nice with your art style! Thank you for your consideration.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nmr22kt4n/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1564408, "client_id": 140313, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e92192e/uploads/origins/81e636b7-4c89-47be-a23c-7cccc6baf86f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e7f5ca4a6f0e8c0fd6840ace7531d82a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e92192e/uploads/origins/81e636b7-4c89-47be-a23c-7cccc6baf86f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e7f5ca4a6f0e8c0fd6840ace7531d82a, https://si.imgix.net/0e92192e/uploads/origins/81e636b7-4c89-47be-a23c-7cccc6baf86f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5501182d886c58ffe276f9726ba5d423 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e92192e/uploads/origins/81e636b7-4c89-47be-a23c-7cccc6baf86f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ba781b8181d150ba9117977d026816a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e92192e/uploads/origins/81e636b7-4c89-47be-a23c-7cccc6baf86f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=58cdba9d76703dcdc8ab3aa252276ab6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e92192e/uploads/origins/81e636b7-4c89-47be-a23c-7cccc6baf86f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=58cdba9d76703dcdc8ab3aa252276ab6, https://si.imgix.net/0e92192e/uploads/origins/81e636b7-4c89-47be-a23c-7cccc6baf86f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=be3573ba2639b8f4838e145f69984a73 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e92192e/uploads/origins/81e636b7-4c89-47be-a23c-7cccc6baf86f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cf6ddaf0855abe14666345e3f3e1c063 3x"}, "body": "Thank you very much for the last time.\nThe delivery we received was very cute and very good.\nI would like to ask if you could draw Mee again if you like.\nI will leave the composition and situations to you.\n\n---If you have any ideas, please let me know.\nIf you need some ideas, please refer to the following sentences.\nSleeping curled up on the grass or bedding.\nLooking into the distance from a high place (chimney, etc.)\nSmiling when being petted.\nFlying comfortably\nBathing in water\nDripping milk from his fingertips into a bottle.\nSleeps with a sleeping partner and gently drains his energy (luminescence)\nSits on or embraces a crescent moon, or otherwise entangles the moon.\nThey look comfortable having their hair sheared by a third party.\nBroken horns.\nSquatting and peering at small objects\n\nYou can check the following URL for a rough idea of the materials\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/99333545\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/70796264", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nmr22kt4n/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ff6596f2/uploads/origins/fe770f19-7334-40c6-8ffa-286fe332afbc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=abc858d3b4061e24ad825a64f4457831", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ff6596f2/uploads/origins/fe770f